            "heading": "Thoughtful Choices, Lasting Pieces",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Using pieces thoughtfully, cleaning them properly, storing them with care, and appreciating the natural signs of everyday use can all help extend their place in our homes. We believe beautiful objects are meant to be lived with, not simply displayed.</p><p>Our approach to sustainability will continue to develop as Toit Studio grows. We want to make more considered decisions wherever we can, while being transparent about what we do today and where there is still room to improve. Rather than claiming perfection, we prefer progress that is thoughtful, practical, and genuine.</p>"
